    "description": "Clip Art Collectible Novelty Pens - Lot of 12 Pieces\nGenuine ClipArt, Novelty Writing Instruments\nOriginal Clear Acrylic Capsule Display Packaging\nThis collection features twelve distinctive Genuine ClipArt ballpoint pens, each presented in its signature clear plastic display capsule with molded logo stand band. Known for unique themed designs and decorative pocket clips, these pens include themed editions such as the LA Earthquake seismograph design, San Francisco F-line streetcar, and clouds over cork styling, making them sought-after collectibles from the era.\nItems Included:\nLA Earthquake Seismograph Pen with California State Enamel Clip\nSan Francisco F Streetcar Trolley Theme Pen\nBlue Barrel Pen with White Cloud Motif and Cork Finish\nBrushed Metallic Silver Finish Pens (Multiple Variants)\nAssorted Themed Novelty Ballpoint Pens in Factory Cases (Total 12 Pens)\nCondition:\nAll 12 pens are housed in their original clear plastic capsule cases. Exterior plastic cases exhibit light surface scratching, scuffs, and shelf wear consistent with handling and storage. Barcode stickers and pricing labels remain intact on multiple case bases. Pens appear unused and intact inside cases; ink cartridges are untested for writing functionality.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not